Package: gsDose
Type: Package
Title: Group Sequential Multi-Arm Multi-Stage Phase 2/3 Design with Dose Selection
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Eric (Pingye)", family = "Zhang",
    email = "pingyezhangusc@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the statistical testing framework for a multi-arm
    multi-stage group sequential seamless phase 2/3 design with dose selection
    for oncology trials with a survival endpoint, as described in Zhang and Jin
    (2025) <doi:10.1080/19466315.2025.2539831>. Provides the inverse normal
    combination test combining patient cohorts enrolled before and after dose
    selection, Dunnett-based closed testing across dose arms, and group
    sequential efficacy boundaries based on alpha spending functions.
